      en: ["The Matobo Hills were designated a UNESCO World Heritage site in 2003.", "The granite formations are estimated to be over 2 billion years old.", "Over 3,000 registered San rock art sites are found within the hills.", "Cecil Rhodes was buried at World’s View in the year 1902.", "The national park boasts one of Africa's highest leopard densities.", "The hills serve as the spiritual heart of the Mwali religion in Zimbabwe."],
